`III.1(c) — electrical machinery damaged by its own over-running, short-circuit, self-heating, arcing or leakage` l MEANS
        l's `item`'s `electrical machinery, apparatus or installation`
    AND l's `the item itself suffered over-running, excessive pressure, short-circuiting, self-heating, arcing or leakage of electricity`

§§ `III.1(d) — pollution`

-- Pollution or contamination, except DAMAGE to insured property caused by (i) pollution
-- that itself results from an insured risk, or (ii) an insured risk that itself results
-- from pollution. "(trừ khi đã bị loại trừ)" sits after the main limb; it is read as the
-- usual "unless otherwise excluded", which leaves the other exclusions to operate on their
-- own and adds nothing here (fork F10).
-- src:182 | (d) Gây ra do ô nhiễm hoặc nhiễm bẩn (trừ khi đã bị loại trừ) trừ những TỔN HẠI của tài
-- src:183 | sản được bảo hiểm gây ra bởi:
-- src:184 | (i) ô nhiễm hoặc nhiễm bẩn từ chính các rủi ro được bảo hiểm,
-- src:185 | (ii) bất kỳ rủi ro được bảo hiểm nào phát sinh từ ô nhiễm hoặc nhiễm bẩn
GIVEN c IS A `The claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`III.1(d) — pollution or contamination, not from or causing an insured risk` c MEANS
        c's `facts`'s `pollution or contamination`
    AND NOT c's `facts`'s `the pollution or contamination itself resulted from an insured risk`
    AND NOT c's `facts`'s `an insured risk itself resulted from the pollution or contamination`

§§ `III.2 — property excluded`

-- (a) the named categories, "trừ khi được ghi nhận là được bảo hiểm trong hợp đồng bảo
-- hiểm này" (unless recorded as insured in this policy). An item stated in the Summary
-- only as part of a wider class (contents, stock) is not thereby recorded (fork F11).
