-- src:188 | máy tính, vật mẫu, khuôn vẽ, bản thiết kế, chất nổ, trừ khi được ghi nhận là được bảo
-- src:189 | hiểm trong hợp đồng bảo hiểm này;
GIVEN l IS A `A claimed loss`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`III.2(a) — property of a category named in III.2(a), not recorded as insured` l MEANS
        NOT (l's `item`'s `category` EQUALS `property of no category named in III.2(a)`)
    AND NOT l's `item`'s `specifically recorded as insured in this policy`

-- (b) property insured, or that but for this policy would be insured, under a marine
-- policy, "ngoại trừ phần thiệt hại vượt quá" (except the part of the damage beyond) what
-- the marine policy pays or would pay. A measure: what this policy may pay toward the loss.
