-- src:193 | được bồi thường theo hợp đồng bảo hiểm hàng hải nếu không có hợp đồng bảo hiểm
-- src:194 | này.
GIVEN l IS A `A claimed loss`
      `the damage` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`III.2(b) — the part of the damage beyond what the marine policy pays` l `the damage` MEANS
    IF   l's `insured, or but for this policy would be insured, under a marine policy`
    THEN max 0 (`the damage` MINUS l's `amount recoverable under the marine policy`)
    ELSE `the damage`

§§ `III.3 — consequential loss`

-- Consequential damage or loss of any kind, except loss of rent where rent is insured
-- under this policy. The heads read as consequential are the two D.2(a)-(b) also names
-- (fork F12).
-- src:195 | 3. Tổn hại hoặc tổn thất hậu quả dưới bất kỳ hình thức nào ngoại trừ tổn thất mất tiền thuê nhà
-- src:196 | nếu tiền thuê nhà được bảo hiểm theo hợp đồng bảo hiểm này.
GIVEN s IS A `The Policy Summary`
      l IS A `A claimed loss`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`III.3 — consequential loss, other than rent insured under this policy` s l MEANS
    CONSIDER l's `head of loss`
    WHEN `loss of income, delay, loss of market, or other consequential or indirect loss` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `loss from stopping or interrupting work, a process or an operation`              THEN TRUE
    WHEN `loss of rent`                                                                    THEN NOT s's `rent insured under this policy`
    OTHERWISE FALSE

§§ `III.4 — theft during or after a fire`

-- src:198 | 4. Tổn thất do trộm cướp trong khi hoặc sau khi xảy ra cháy
GIVEN c IS A `The claim`
      l IS A `A claimed loss`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`III.4 — loss by theft or robbery during or after a fire` c l MEANS
        l's `caused by theft, robbery or attempted theft`
    AND `I — Fire` (c's `facts`)

§ `Section VIII — special endorsements that exclude`

-- src:371 | VIII. SỬA ĐỔI BỔ SUNG ĐẶC BIỆT

§§ `VIII.1(a) — electronic data`

-- (i) excludes loss of or damage to ELECTRONIC DATA, from any cause (a COMPUTER VIRUS
-- included), and loss of use, reduced functionality and cost of any kind, whatever else
-- contributed. Its objects are the data and those consequences; physical damage to
-- tangible property is not among them (fork F14).
