-- src:393 | bảo hiểm phát sinh trong thời hạn bảo hiểm trực tiếp gây bởi cháy và/hoặc nổ.

§§ `VIII.2 — date recognition`

-- Part 1 excludes loss, damage, cost or claim arising from (a) a computer or chip handling
-- a date change (year 2000, any other date, a leap year), or (b) a change or modification
-- relating to one, whatever else contributed, and whether or not the system was the
-- Insured's.
